     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Condition and consequence",
     "texto": [
      "**Hvis** introduces a condition: **Hvis du deler posisjonen, kan appen vise hvor du er** («If you share your position, the app can show where you are»). You can describe the effect with **derfor** («therefore») or **slik at** («so that»). Distinguish between what the policy says and a possible consequence you are inferring."
     ],
